{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":4576485,"ns":0,"title":"Brauer's theorem on forms","extract":"There also is Brauer's theorem on induced characters.\nIn mathematics, Brauer's theorem, named for Richard Brauer, is a result on the representability of 0 by forms over certain fields in sufficiently many variables.","description":"On the representability of 0 by forms over certain fields in sufficiently many variables","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}